      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "这鱼命真好啊。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.257,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/45-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "没什么。每天换点水，别喂多。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 3.614,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/46-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "天天啊。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.691,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/47-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "天天。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.669,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/48-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "他停了一下。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.809,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/49-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "你怎么一直不换个地方。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.96,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/50-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我这不是挺好的吗。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.256,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/51-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.6,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "你天天都说没意思。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.743,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/52-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "是啊。可也没什么好换的，换哪儿不都一样。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 4.032,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/53-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.5,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "他没接话，把箱子换了只手。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.284,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/54-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "然后我说了一句，我自己都没想到会说出口的话。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 3.54,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/55-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "其实吧。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.701,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/56-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我那不叫看得开。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.052,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/57-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.6,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "你干完一件事，你心里有个数。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.547,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/58-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我什么都不干，我就永远不用知道自己到底行不行。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 3.961,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/59-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我天天说没意思。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.016,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/60-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.6,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "说得跟我多明白似的。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.305,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/61-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我哪明白啊。我就是……"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.338,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/62-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.5,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我就是没敢试。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.101,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/63-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "说完我就有点后悔。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.06,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/64-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.5,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "老牛看了我一会儿。他没说\"你别这么想\"，也没说\"其实你挺好的\"。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 4.909,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/65-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 2,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "那你现在知道了。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.482,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/66-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "他走了，往地铁站那边。走了几步又停住，把手里的鱼缸放地上，回头冲我招手，让我过去。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 8.252,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/67-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我过去了。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.597,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/68-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.5,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "这个你拿着吧。我路上不好带。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 3.367,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/69-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "_layer": "台词",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我养不活啊。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 0.934,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/70-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "niu",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "gain": 0.89,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "能。就是每天换点水。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.575,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/71-niu.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.2,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "说完他就走了。这回没回头。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.618,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/72-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.3,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我把鱼缸拎回工位，搁在窗台上。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.684,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/73-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.4,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "那天晚上加班的人不多，屋里挺静。我坐那儿看了那条鱼一会儿。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 5.058,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/74-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "它不大，颜色也一般，游得很慢。四年了。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 4.446,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/75-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.6,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我想起下午那句\"那是他的事\"。他写那十一页的时候，压根没指望谁看。他把这鱼养四年，也没指望这鱼能怎么样。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 9.419,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/76-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "他不图什么。他就是干完。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 2.502,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/77-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.2,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我一直以为他傻。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.048,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/78-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.6,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "十一点我走的时候，给鱼换了点水。换得不多，拿杯子接了半杯，倒进去，看了两分钟。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 7.736,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/79-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 0.8,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "第二天我还是七点半到，坐我那位置，活还是那些活。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 4.64,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/80-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "setup",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1,
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我没变成老牛。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.146,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/81-ma.wav"
    },
    {
      "who": "ma",
      "beat": "punch",
      "padBefore": 0.2,
      "padAfter": 1.5,
      "note": "黑场",
      "_layer": "旁白",
      "say": [
        {
          "text": "我就是每天换点水。"
        }
      ],
      "dur": 1.305,
      "audio": "out/voice/laoma-long-001/82-ma.wav"
    }
  ],
